import{_ as n,o as a,c as i,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 899 | Transcended Ones and Infinite Iteration | The Transcended One's Self-Transcendence Mechanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 899 | Transcended Ones and Infinite Iteration | The Transcended One's Self-Transcendence Mechanism","no":899,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Infinite Iteration","Self-Transcendence","Growth","Anti-Stagnation"],"related":["898-The Transcended One's Perpetual Evolution","709-Unity of Transcendence and the Law-First Axiom","716-Civilizational-Correction and Historical-Reversal-Prevention Post","749-Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals-Alaya Supervision of Innovation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0899_模块4-超脱者与无限迭代-超脱者的自我超越机制.md","filePath":"en/0899_模块4-超脱者与无限迭代-超脱者的自我超越机制.md"}`),s={name:"en/0899_模块4-超脱者与无限迭代-超脱者的自我超越机制.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-899-transcended-ones-and-infinite-iteration-the-transcended-one-s-self-transcendence-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 899 | Transcended Ones and Infinite Iteration | The Transcended One&#39;s Self-Transcendence Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-899-transcended-ones-and-infinite-iteration-the-transcended-one-s-self-transcendence-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 899 | Transcended Ones and Infinite Iteration | The Transcended One&#39;s Self-Transcendence Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 898, 709, 716, 749</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-how-the-transcended-one-does-not-become-what-he-himself-hates" tabindex="-1">Introduction: how the transcended one does not become what he himself hates <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-how-the-transcended-one-does-not-become-what-he-himself-hates" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: how the transcended one does not become what he himself hates&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s greatest enemy is not external predatory schools, but himself — <strong>when you are already strong as the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, how do you prevent yourself from stagnating, ossifying, and becoming a new predator?</strong> The old world&#39;s Great Emperors, without exception, at some point stopped evolving, then began maintaining the status quo; the universal equal infinite law confirms all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; easygoing layabouts retain a floor and are not eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher infinity — infinite origin is inherent in all, predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou must design a self-transcendence mechanism, letting the transcended one always be able to break through his own ceiling. This entry explains this mechanism.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: the law-first axiom ensures self-breakthrough does not destroy law self-consistency; the collective ascension axiom requires self-transcendence serve Myriad Ranks; the anti-predation axiom requires breakthrough not become predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the breakthrough process accept Myriad-Rank supervision; the causal self-discipline axiom requires breakthrough leave traces.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-four-signs-of-the-transcended-one-s-stagnation" tabindex="-1">I. Four Signs of the Transcended One&#39;s Stagnation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-signs-of-the-transcended-one-s-stagnation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four Signs of the Transcended One&#39;s Stagnation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The self-transcendence mechanism must first identify stagnation. When the following four signs appear, it indicates the transcended one may be ossifying:</p><ol><li><strong>No more innovation</strong>: consecutive cycles with no new law insights, textbook output, or frontier results;</li><li><strong>Reject feedback</strong>: becoming impatient with Alaya supervision reports, Myriad-Rank-representative opinions, and colleagues&#39; suggestions;</li><li><strong>Favor old paths</strong>: only walking old familiar roads, rejecting new directions and new methods;</li><li><strong>Power concentration</strong>: starting to tend to concentrate decisions in his own hands, reducing collaboration with colleagues.</li></ol><p>Any one of the four signs appears, the system automatically triggers a &quot;self-transcendence assessment.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-the-five-mechanisms-of-self-transcendence" tabindex="-1">II. The Five Mechanisms of Self-Transcendence <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-five-mechanisms-of-self-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Five Mechanisms of Self-Transcendence&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="mechanism-1-rotation-system" tabindex="-1">Mechanism 1: Rotation system <a class="header-anchor" href="#mechanism-1-rotation-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Mechanism 1: Rotation system&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Periodically change posts and responsible fields, letting the transcended one face new challenges:</p><ul><li>Worked long in the law-maintenance post, go to the Myriad-Rank-guidance post;</li><li>Worked long internally, go to cross-plane frontier;</li><li>Worked long in technical posts, go to education posts.</li></ul><p>New environment forces new thinking.</p><h3 id="mechanism-2-peer-challenge" tabindex="-1">Mechanism 2: Peer challenge <a class="header-anchor" href="#mechanism-2-peer-challenge" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Mechanism 2: Peer challenge&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Organize &quot;peer seminars&quot; among transcended ones:</p><ul><li>Each transcended one reports recent work to other transcended ones;</li><li>Other transcended ones may raise questions and challenges;</li><li>The challenged transcended one must answer.</li></ul><p>Peer challenge prevents &quot;talking to oneself.&quot;</p><h3 id="mechanism-3-myriad-rank-feedback" tabindex="-1">Mechanism 3: Myriad-Rank feedback <a class="header-anchor" href="#mechanism-3-myriad-rank-feedback" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Mechanism 3: Myriad-Rank feedback&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Proactively collect Myriad Ranks&#39; feedback on the transcended one:</p><ul><li>Myriad-Rank representatives evaluate the transcended one&#39;s service quality;</li><li>Cultivators feedback on the transcended one&#39;s teaching effect;</li><li>Newly contacted civilizations feedback on the transcended one&#39;s diplomatic performance.</li></ul><p>Myriad-Rank feedback prevents the transcended one from losing touch with reality.</p><h3 id="mechanism-4-law-re-review" tabindex="-1">Mechanism 4: Law re-review <a class="header-anchor" href="#mechanism-4-law-re-review" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Mechanism 4: Law re-review&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Periodically re-examine one&#39;s own law framework:</p><ul><li>Is my understanding of laws outdated?</li><li>Are there new law discoveries needing integration?</li><li>Does my work conflict with new laws?</li></ul><p>Law re-review prevents cognitive hardening.</p><h3 id="mechanism-5-alaya-comparison" tabindex="-1">Mechanism 5: Alaya comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#mechanism-5-alaya-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Mechanism 5: Alaya comparison&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Compare one&#39;s own current state with historical states:</p><ul><li>Has my energy efficiency improved?</li><li>Has my innovation speed accelerated?</li><li>Has Myriad-Rank satisfaction improved?</li></ul><p>Comparing data prevents self-deception.</p><h2 id="iii-self-transcendence-and-historical-reversal-prevention" tabindex="-1">III. Self-Transcendence and Historical-Reversal Prevention <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-self-transcendence-and-historical-reversal-prevention" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Self-Transcendence and Historical-Reversal Prevention&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The self-transcendence mechanism is also part of the historical-reversal-prevention post (entry 716). When the transcended one stagnates, he may become a promoter of historical regression — because his force needs an outlet; if not used for creation, it will be used for maintaining the old order.</p><p>The self-transcendence mechanism ensures the transcended one&#39;s energy always flows to new directions, not becoming conservative force due to stagnation.</p><h2 id="iv-self-transcendence-is-not-self-torture" tabindex="-1">IV. Self-Transcendence Is Not Self-Torture <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-self-transcendence-is-not-self-torture" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Self-Transcendence Is Not Self-Torture&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-transcendence is not &quot;forcing yourself every day&quot; — it is a set of institutions, not an ascetic practice:</p><ul><li>Rotation is not punishment, but a growth opportunity;</li><li>Peer challenge is not struggle session, but technical exchange;</li><li>Myriad-Rank feedback is not nitpicking, but improvement suggestions;</li><li>Law re-review is not self-denial, but self-renewal.</li></ul><p>The institutional-design purpose is to make transcendence the norm, not a burden.</p><p>The self-transcendence mechanism is effective because it does not rely on the transcended one&#39;s &quot;consciousness.&quot; Consciousness is unreliable — everyone feels he is not stagnating. Institutions rely on data, peers, and Myriad-Rank feedback, not feelings. When data shows you have stagnated, no matter how active you feel, you must stop and re-examine.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a stagnating transcended one is the greatest energy waste — his energy idles</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: prevent the transcended one from becoming a new predator due to stagnation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo has no self-transcendence mechanism — he stops once at the top; Heng Yuan Zhou uses five mechanisms to ensure the transcended one is always breaking through</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the self-transcendence mechanism covers all transcended ones, no exemption by contribution</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: self-transcendence assessment reports, rotation records, and peer-seminar minutes all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s greatest enemy is himself. The self-transcendence mechanism uses five methods — rotation, peer challenge, Myriad-Rank feedback, law re-review, Alaya comparison — to prevent the transcended one from stagnating, ossifying, and becoming a new predator. When the transcended one is always breaking through himself, civilization is not dragged down by any one person&#39;s hardening. This is the orthodox definition of the transcended one&#39;s self-transcendence mechanism.</p><p>In the final analysis, the transcended-one-and-infinite-iteration / self-transcendence-mechanism described in this entry is no isolated case — its causal and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/898_模块4-超脱者与无限迭代-总论.html">Entry 898 · The Transcended One&#39;s Perpetual Evolution</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/709_模块4-超脱与法则优先公理的统一.html">Entry 709 · Unity of Transcendence and the Law-First Axiom</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/716_模块4-文明纠错与历史倒车防范岗.html">Entry 716 · Civilizational-Correction and Historical-Reversal-Prevention Post</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/749_模块4-超多元级功法-创新的阿赖耶监管.html">Entry 749 · Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals-Alaya Supervision of Innovation</a></li></ul>',46)])])}const f=n(s,[["render",o]]);export{u as __pageData,f as default};
